 "body": "## What changes\n\n- **Fix:** `fill_mcp_described` (`features/common/skills/welcome-ai-badger/scripts/mcp_tools.py`) ignored `config.mcp.decline`. A declined server lost its launch config but kept its `## MCP Tools: <name>` section in every generated agent file. Now it is skipped.\n- **Self-scaffold:** ai-badger no longer scaffolds itself with the `hermes` stack or agent.\n  - `config.stacks` / `confi\n[truncated]",
